+<p class="eyebrow">The work</p>
+<h2 id="work-h">What I've built</h2>
+</div></div>
+<ul style="max-width:720px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;padding-left:20px;">
+<li><a href="../foreman/" style="color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;">Foreman</a> — free quoting, jobs and invoicing for tradies.</li>
+<li><a href="../takeoff/" style="color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;">Takeoff</a> — measure off a plan and turn it into a priced quote.</li>
+<li><a href="../ledger/" style="color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;">Ledger</a> — cash flow, GST and BAS for sole-trader tradies.</li>
+<li><a href="../catalogue/" style="color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;">Trade Catalogues</a> and <a href="../roster/" style="color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;">Roster</a> — for suppliers and clubs.</li>
+<li><a href="../glassbox/" style="color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;">Glassbox</a> — open source, on npm as <code>glassbox-trace</code>. Also <code>get-bearings</code>. Both on <a href="https://github.com/aldohushi1-stack" style="color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;" rel="me noopener">GitHub</a>.</li>
+<li>Custom builds for Adelaide businesses, including the <a href="../projects/adtrade/" style="color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;">Adtrade ordering tool</a>.</li>
+</ul>
+</div>
