+<div class="proof" style="margin-top:14px;">
+<p>"I'm not chasing anymore, I'm just clicking."</p>
+<p class="attr">&mdash; <b>Domenic</b>, Adtrade Industrial Supplies, Adelaide — on the <a href="../projects/adtrade/" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none;">Adtrade ordering tool</a></p>
+</div>
+<p style="text-align:center;margin-top:34px;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-3);">Twenty-five builds shipped from the lab, including the free <a href="../foreman/" style="color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;">Foreman</a>, <a href="../takeoff/" style="color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;">Takeoff</a> and <a href="../ledger/" style="color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;">Ledger</a> trade tools — every one of them clickable on the <a href="../#lab" style="color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;">lab page</a>.</p>
