+<section class="seo-about" aria-labelledby="seo-about-h"><h2 id="seo-about-h">Foreman — free quoting, jobs and invoicing for tradies</h2><p>Free quoting, job tracking, crew scheduling and GST tax invoices for Australian tradies. No subscription, no lock-in, runs in your browser. From BlueprintAU.</p><h3>Is Foreman really free?</h3><p>Yes. Foreman is free forever, with no user limits, no quote or invoice caps, and no card required. There&#x27;s an optional tip jar if you want to shout the lab a beer.</p><h3>Does Foreman handle GST and produce a valid Australian tax invoice?</h3><p>Yes. Prices are entered ex GST, GST is calculated at 10%, and every invoice carries the words &#x27;Tax invoice&#x27;, your business name and ABN, the date, an itemised description, and the GST amount and inc-GST total — the elements the ATO requires.</p><h3>Where is my data stored?</h3><p>In your own browser on your own device. Nothing is uploaded to a server. Export the workspace to Excel to back it up or move it to another computer, and import it back with the same file.</p><h3>Can I bring in my existing clients and price list?</h3><p>Yes. Download the Excel template from the welcome screen, fill in clients, crew, price book, jobs and invoices, and import the .xlsx or .csv. You can also start from the loaded demo business to see how it all fits together.</p><h3>Does it work on a phone or tablet?</h3><p>Foreman is a web app and runs in any modern browser on desktop, tablet or phone. It&#x27;s laid out for a screen at least the size of a tablet, where the quote builder and schedule are easiest to use.</p><h3>What trades is Foreman for?</h3><p>Any Australian trade that quotes, schedules and invoices: electrical, plumbing, carpentry, tiling, painting, landscaping, fencing, air conditioning, roofing, concreting and general building maintenance.</p><p style="margin-top:18px;">Need a tool built around how your business works? <a href="../build/">Custom software, one tool, $2,000 fixed →</a></p></section>
